sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as Next.js
  participant BFF as Node BFF
  participant FS as Firestore
  participant API as FastAPI dispatcher
  participant G as Cloud Storage
  participant BQ as BigQuery
  participant T as Cloud Tasks
  participant AE as Agent runtime
  participant S as Session service
  participant V as Vertex AI
  FE->>BFF: Run node (Playspace ID, mode, parents, idempotency key)
  BFF->>BFF: Session cookie to owner key, ownership, lineage, cost limits
  BFF->>FS: Transaction - idempotency record and Playspace lock
  BFF->>API: Create job (owner key) with service ID token
  API->>API: Resolve DAG, assemble context
  API->>G: Write immutable manifest
  API->>BQ: QUEUED and RESERVED rows
  API->>T: Enqueue job ID
  API-->>BFF: Job ID
  BFF-->>FE: Accepted, job ID
  Note over FE,BFF: Frontend polls from here, refresh-safe
  T->>AE: OAuth2 trigger with job ID
  AE->>FS: Claim - attempt n, 60 s lease
  AE->>G: Read manifest
  AE->>S: Get, create or recreate session
  AE->>FS: CAS bind session mapping
  AE->>S: Project context into state
  AE->>V: Plan (one LLM call)
  AE->>BQ: PLANNED with plan
  loop Each slot
    AE->>FS: Pre-flight lease and deadline
    AE->>V: Generate one image
    AE->>G: Create-only write via artifact function
    AE->>AE: Decode and verify
    AE->>BQ: SLOT_SAVED with object URI
  end
  AE->>BQ: COMPLETED with node summary
  AE->>FS: Release Playspace lock
  FE->>BFF: Poll status
  BFF->>BQ: Owner-scoped latest state (cached 1-2 s)
  BFF-->>FE: Slot states
  FE->>BFF: Get image
  BFF->>G: Owner and path check, stream bytes
  BFF-->>FE: Image (private, immutable)
